5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Hello everyone. Since our current system is a relic from when we were fewer, it's only logical to update it. I'd like to see the ""Winter habits at a house paying ahead"" and ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room.""","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I agree! It's definitely time for a change. I want to see the ""Trial run of a reconciliation template"" and the ""Monthly settle observed at another house"" to see how much work it actually is!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I think it's important to understand if our current usage is actually balanced. I'll look into the ""Plug-in monitor readings room by room"" and the ""Payment log for the last twelve months.""","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that we need a clearer picture. I would like to look into ""The last twelve utility statements"" and the ""Electrician's quote for the rooms"" to understand our costs and potential setup fees.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know how we've been getting along with the money. I'll look into the ""Payment log for the last twelve months"" and ""Settling up when the last rooms filled.""","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a comprehensive list covered. @Victoria, your focus on the costs is prudent. I'm curious if the monitor readings will reveal a significant disparity in how we use the energy.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm just worried that whoever does the math is going to be super stressed! @Jonathan, do you think the payment log will show if people are actually complaining about the work involved?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the log might show delays or disputes, which often point to frustration. I want to see if the friction comes from the amount being asked or the process itself.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"That is a valid point, @Jonathan. I suspect the friction may stem from the unpredictability of the amounts. Understanding the seasonal fluctuations will help us determine if a more stable system is necessary.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a way to make everyone feel happy again. I think it's important to see if the way we've handled things in the past has made people feel bad.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree with Minato. The atmosphere in the house is just as important as the arithmetic. If we find that the current system creates tension, we should prioritize a solution that minimizes conflict.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! I just don't want the ""solution"" to be a giant headache for one person. If the new system is too complicated, we'll just be back to arguing in a few months!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Mio. A system that is fair on paper but exhausting in practice isn't a real solution. We need a balance between accuracy and simplicity to maintain our peace.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. A system that is too complex to maintain will inevitably lead to the same friction we are trying to avoid. We must ensure the chosen method is sustainable for everyone involved.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I agree with everyone. I just hope that whatever we choose, it helps us be kinder to each other and stops the reminders from feeling like fights.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we are all in agreement on the goals, let's proceed. I look forward to seeing what our research reveals so we can make a logical, sustainable choice for the household.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
